sequenceDiagram
    participant F as Frontend
    participant S as Backend
    participant DB as Database
    participant C as Cookie
    participant Store as AuthStore

    Note over F,S: Шаг 1 - Инициализация CSRF
    F->>S: GET /api/csrf-token
    S->>S: generateToken = nonce + HMAC(CSRF_SECRET)
    S->>C: Set-Cookie csrfToken=nonce.signature
    S->>F: 200 {csrfToken: nonce.signature}

    Note over F,S: Шаг 2 - Аутентификация
    F->>S: POST /api/auth/login {email, password}
    Note right of S: Пропускает CSRF для /auth/*
    S->>DB: getUserByEmail(email)
    DB->>S: user {id, email, hashedPassword}
    S->>S: bcrypt.compare(password, hash)
    S->>S: jwt.sign({id,email,role}, JWT_SECRET)
    S->>F: 200 {user, token}
    F->>Store: useAuthStore.login(token, user)
    Store->>Store: persist to localStorage

    Note over F,S: Шаг 3 - Защищенный запрос
    F->>F: axios interceptor - читает cookie
    F->>S: POST /api/auctions {data}
    Note over F,S: Authorization: Bearer token + X-CSRF-Token header

    S->>S: generateCsrfToken middleware
    S->>S: verifyCsrfToken - cookie === header

    alt CSRF FAIL
        S->>F: 403 Неверный CSRF токен
    else CSRF OK
        S->>S: authMiddleware - jwt.verify(token)
        alt JWT FAIL
            S->>F: 401 Invalid token
        else JWT OK
            S->>S: req.user = {id, email, role}
            S->>DB: auctions.create({userId: req.user.id})
            DB->>S: newAuction
            S->>F: 201 {auction}
        end
    end
